SCOPE

This licence covers the source code in this repository only: scripts/,
src/soundml/, figures_r/ and the build tooling.

It does NOT cover:

  * The audio and physiological corpora the analyses read. Nine corpora with
    nine different sets of terms — several CC BY-NC, one academic-use-only, one
    with no audio redistribution right at all. Their conditions, and whether
    derived files may be redistributed, are listed in DATA_LICENSES.md. None of that
    audio is in this repository.

  * The manuscript text and figures, which are released under CC BY 4.0
    alongside the preprint.

  * The tables under reports/source_data/. Most are aggregate statistics, but
    NOT all of them: soundtracks_onset_sharpness.csv, for one, is a complete
    per-item feature table covering all 360 excerpts of Soundtracks Set 1. That
    deposit is CC BY 4.0, so redistributing the derived table is permitted with
    attribution -- but "aggregate statistics" would be the wrong description of
    it, and the distinction matters for any table derived from a corpus whose
    terms are narrower. Reuse remains subject to the upstream terms recorded in
    DATA_LICENSES.md, per corpus, in the "derivatives redistributable" column.
